{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9801494566639331", "organization": {"id": "465081523306746", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "9801494566639331"}]}, "id": "2166946570442625"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "9801494566639331", "release_date": 1762426800, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 9}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27061106450251541"}, "id": "711362431518276"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1784100457, "id": "27157544923941026", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v32", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 13, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "27157959020566283"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "9801494566639331"}, "id": "27157959020566283", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "9801494566639331", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "569948496142788"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28028028733500132", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RealityGuard", "keywords": ["Turmverteidigung", "MixedReality", "Koop", "Magie", "Raumverteidigung"], "long_description": "**Verwandle dein Zimmer in ein Fantasy-Schlachtfeld.**\n\n**RealityGuard ist ein kooperatives Mixed-Reality-Verteidigungsspiel, in dem dein echter Raum Teil des Kampfes wird.** Baue magische T\u00fcrme auf echten M\u00f6beln, forme die Wege der Gegner durch dein Zimmer, wirke Zauber mit deinen H\u00e4nden und verteidige dein Zuhause gegen Wellen von Fantasy-Invasoren.\n\n**Spiele solo, im Online-Team, im lokalen Koop oder fordere andere im PVP-Modus heraus.** Du schaust nicht nur zu: Friere Gegner ein, l\u00f6se Turmwaffen aus und greif ein, wenn deine Verteidigung f\u00e4llt.\n\n{1927332117937243}\n\n- **Verteidige dein echtes Zimmer**\n\nVerwandle Tische, Sofas, B\u00f6den und W\u00e4nde in dein Schlachtfeld.\n\n{1575772194094948}\n\n- **Online- und lokaler Koop**\n\nBaue, schie\u00dfe, wirke Zauber und \u00fcberlebe mit Freunden \u2013 online oder im selben Raum.\n\n- **Wirke Zauber und wehre dich**\n\nFriere Gegner ein, sprenge Wellen, l\u00f6se Fallen aus und k\u00e4mpfe direkt mit.\n\n{1806366013855298}\n\n- **Errichte m\u00e4chtige Verteidigungen**\n\nSchalte T\u00fcrme, Karten, Upgrades und F\u00e4higkeiten frei f\u00fcr neue Strategien.\n\n- **Herausforderungs- und Endlos-Modi**\n\nMeistere Story-Level, Events, Wetter, Fallen und endlose Wellen. Erklimme die Bestenlisten und verdiene Belohnungen.\n\nRealityGuard ist im Early Access. Tritt unserem Discord bei und gestalte das Spiel mit.\n\nWebsite: https://www.realityguardar.com\n\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/jNmnz9PdVW", "short_description": "Verwandle dein Zimmer in ein Fantasy-Schlachtfeld.\n\nRealityGuard ist ein kooperatives Mixed-Reality-Verteidigungsspiel, in dem dein echter Raum Teil des Kampfes wird. Spiele solo oder schlie\u00dfe dich mit Freunden zusammen \u2013 online oder im selben Zimmer. Baue magische T\u00fcrme auf echten M\u00f6beln, wirke Zauber mit deinen H\u00e4nden und \u00fcberlebe Wellen von Fantasy-Gegnern, die dein Zuhause angreifen."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "3078051709206643", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RealityGuard", "keywords": ["\u5854\u9632", "\u6df7\u5408\u5be6\u5883", "\u5408\u4f5c", "\u9b54\u6cd5", "\u623f\u9593\u9632\u79a6"], "long_description": "**\u628a\u4f60\u7684\u623f\u9593\u8b8a\u6210\u5947\u5e7b\u6230\u5834\u3002**\n\n**RealityGuard \u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u5408\u4f5c\u6df7\u5408\u5be6\u5883\u9632\u79a6\u904a\u6232\uff0c\u4f60\u7684\u771f\u5be6\u7a7a\u9593\u5c07\u6210\u70ba\u6230\u9b25\u7684\u4e00\u90e8\u5206\u3002** \u5728\u771f\u5be6\u5bb6\u5177\u4e0a\u5efa\u9020\u9b54\u6cd5\u5854\uff0c\u6cbf\u8457\u623f\u9593\u5851\u9020\u6575\u4eba\u7684\u9032\u653b\u8def\u7dda\uff0c\u7528\u96d9\u624b\u65bd\u653e\u6cd5\u8853\uff0c\u4fdd\u885b\u5bb6\u5712\u62b5\u64cb\u4e00\u6ce2\u6ce2\u5947\u5e7b\u5165\u4fb5\u8005\u3002\n\n**\u55ae\u4eba\u904a\u73a9\u3001\u7dda\u4e0a\u7d44\u968a\u3001\u672c\u5730\u5408\u4f5c\u4e26\u80a9\u4f5c\u6230\uff0c\u6216\u5728 PVP \u6a21\u5f0f\u6311\u6230\u5176\u4ed6\u73a9\u5bb6\u3002** \u4f60\u4e0d\u53ea\u662f\u770b\u8457\u5854\u81ea\u52d5\u4f5c\u6230\u3002\u51b0\u51cd\u6575\u4eba\u3001\u89f8\u767c\u5854\u7684\u7279\u6b8a\u6b66\u5668\uff0c\u5728\u9632\u7dda\u5373\u5c07\u5d29\u6f70\u6642\u89aa\u81ea\u6295\u5165\u6230\u9b25\u3002\n\n{1690596378895306}\n\n- **\u4fdd\u885b\u4f60\u7684\u771f\u5be6\u623f\u9593**\n\n\u628a\u684c\u5b50\u3001\u6c99\u767c\u3001\u5730\u677f\u548c\u7246\u58c1\u8b8a\u6210\u6230\u5834\u3002\n\n{1054249227080567}\n\n- **\u7dda\u4e0a\u8207\u672c\u5730\u5408\u4f5c**\n\n\u8207\u670b\u53cb\u7dda\u4e0a\u6216\u5728\u540c\u4e00\u500b\u5be6\u9ad4\u7a7a\u9593\u4e2d\u4e00\u8d77\u5efa\u9020\u3001\u5c04\u64ca\u3001\u65bd\u6cd5\u3001\u6c42\u751f\u3002\n\n- **\u65bd\u653e\u6cd5\u8853\u53cd\u64ca**\n\n\u51b0\u51cd\u6575\u4eba\u3001\u8f5f\u6563\u6575\u6f6e\u3001\u89f8\u767c\u9677\u9631\u3001\u89aa\u81ea\u4e0a\u9663\u6230\u9b25\u3002\n\n{948688531526021}\n\n- **\u6253\u9020\u5f37\u5927\u9632\u7dda**\n\n\u89e3\u9396\u5854\u3001\u5361\u724c\u3001\u5347\u7d1a\u8207\u80fd\u529b\uff0c\u5275\u9020\u5168\u65b0\u6230\u8853\u3002\n\n- **\u6311\u6230\u8207\u7121\u76e1\u6a21\u5f0f**\n\n\u6311\u6230\u6545\u4e8b\u95dc\u5361\u3001\u4e8b\u4ef6\u3001\u5929\u6c23\u3001\u9677\u9631\u3001\u6230\u9b25\u52a0\u6210\u8207\u7121\u76e1\u6575\u6f6e\u3002\u6500\u4e0a\u5168\u7403\u6392\u884c\u699c\uff0c\u8d0f\u53d6\u734e\u52f5\u3002\n\nRealityGuard \u76ee\u524d\u70ba\u6436\u5148\u9ad4\u9a57\u7248\u672c\u3002\u6b61\u8fce\u52a0\u5165\u6211\u5011\u7684 Discord\uff0c\u5206\u4eab\u4f60\u7684\u610f\u898b\uff0c\u548c\u6211\u5011\u4e00\u8d77\u6253\u9020\u9019\u6b3e\u904a\u6232\u3002\n\n\u5b98\u65b9\u7db2\u7ad9: https://www.realityguardar.com\n\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/jNmnz9PdVW\n\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@RealityGuard_Official\n\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@realityguard", "short_description": "\u628a\u4f60\u7684\u623f\u9593\u8b8a\u6210\u5947\u5e7b\u6230\u5834\u3002\n\nRealityGuard \u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u5408\u4f5c\u6df7\u5408\u5be6\u5883\u9632\u79a6\u904a\u6232\uff0c\u4f60\u7684\u771f\u5be6\u7a7a\u9593\u5c07\u6210\u70ba\u6230\u9b25\u7684\u4e00\u90e8\u5206\u3002\u53ef\u55ae\u4eba\u904a\u73a9\uff0c\u4e5f\u53ef\u8207\u670b\u53cb\u7dda\u4e0a\u7d44\u968a\u6216\u5728\u540c\u4e00\u500b\u623f\u9593\u4e26\u80a9\u4f5c\u6230\u3002\u5728\u771f\u5be6\u5bb6\u5177\u4e0a\u5efa\u9020\u9b54\u6cd5\u5854\u3001\u7528\u96d9\u624b\u65bd\u653e\u6cd5\u8853\uff0c\u5728\u4e00\u6ce2\u6ce2\u5165\u4fb5\u5bb6\u5712\u7684\u5947\u5e7b\u6575\u4eba\u4e2d\u5b58\u6d3b\u4e0b\u4f86\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2102801877310362", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RealityGuard", "keywords": ["towerdefense", "realitemixte", "coop", "magie", "strategie"], "long_description": "**Transforme ta pi\u00e8ce en champ de bataille fantastique.**\n\n**RealityGuard est un jeu de d\u00e9fense coop\u00e9ratif en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte o\u00f9 ton espace r\u00e9el fait partie du combat.** Construis des tours magiques sur de vrais meubles, fa\u00e7onne le chemin des ennemis dans ta pi\u00e8ce, lance des sorts avec tes mains et d\u00e9fends ta maison contre les vagues d'envahisseurs.\n\n**Joue en solo, en \u00e9quipe en ligne, en coop local ou affronte d'autres joueurs en PVP.** Tu ne fais pas que regarder : g\u00e8le les ennemis, d\u00e9clenche les armes des tours et lance-toi dans l'action quand tes d\u00e9fenses faiblissent.\n\n{3997294837078668}\n\n- **D\u00e9fends ta vraie pi\u00e8ce**\n\nTransforme tables, canap\u00e9s, sols et murs en champ de bataille.\n\n{1310468954198146}\n\n- **Coop en ligne et en local**\n\nConstruis, tire, lance des sorts et survis avec tes amis, en ligne ou dans la m\u00eame pi\u00e8ce.\n\n- **Lance des sorts et contre-attaque**\n\nG\u00e8le les ennemis, pulv\u00e9rise les vagues, d\u00e9clenche des pi\u00e8ges et combats directement.\n\n{1007256542309261}\n\n- **Construis des d\u00e9fenses puissantes**\n\nD\u00e9bloque tours, cartes, am\u00e9liorations et capacit\u00e9s pour cr\u00e9er de nouvelles strat\u00e9gies.\n\n- **Modes D\u00e9fi et Infini**\n\nNiveaux d'histoire, \u00e9v\u00e9nements, m\u00e9t\u00e9o, pi\u00e8ges et vagues infinies. Grimpe dans les classements mondiaux et gagne des r\u00e9compenses.\n\nRealityGuard est en acc\u00e8s anticip\u00e9. Rejoins notre Discord pour partager tes retours.\n\nSite web : https://www.realityguardar.com\n\nDiscord : https://discord.com/invite/jNmnz9PdVW", "short_description": "Transforme ta pi\u00e8ce en champ de bataille fantastique.\n\nRealityGuard est un jeu de d\u00e9fense coop\u00e9ratif en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte o\u00f9 ton espace r\u00e9el fait partie du combat. Joue en solo ou fais \u00e9quipe avec tes amis, en ligne ou dans la m\u00eame pi\u00e8ce. Construis des tours magiques sur tes vrais meubles, lance des sorts avec tes mains et survis aux vagues d'ennemis fantastiques qui envahissent ta maison."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_Title_9000\u200a\u00d7\u200a1440.png", "id": "1973995970065634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827067_1